<!-- part:page -->
The agentic edition of PrompTugal.news reads GAMMA-Ray, RiskMandate's new way to score agentic products, being tried out at Web Summit Lisbon. Each card says how much a product does on its own and how well that is governed, in four dimensions at four levels, from public evidence only.

- **Autonomy (A):** what the agent does on its own.
- **Reach (R):** how connected it is.
- **Control (C):** how its power is bounded and checked.
- **Openness (O):** how much it shows of how it works.

Every rating is beta and provisional, and open to correction by the company. The cards below are ranked by stage, the furthest along first. Each links to its page on [gamma-ray.sgit.ai](https://gamma-ray.sgit.ai/spectrum/), where every level has its evidence.

